      "title": "Delete user route lacks admin check",
      "description": "The DELETE /users/:id route omits the requireAdmin middleware. Both sibling routes in this router apply requireAdmin, and src/server.js adds no router-level guard. Any caller who reaches the server can delete any user by id. This includes callers with no session. Add requireAdmin to the DELETE route, as the sibling routes do.",
      "suggested_change": "admin.delete(\"/users/:id\", requireAdmin, async (req, res) => {",
      "source": null,
