      "title": "New delete routes have no tests",
      "description": "This change adds the delete and purge routes, and the repository has no test that calls them. Without tests, the missing auth and the crash on an unknown id went unnoticed. Future regressions in these routes will go unnoticed too. Add tests that cover auth, an unknown id and a mixed purge list for both routes.",
